{"id":"valor","lemma":"valor","pos":"noun","rank":858,"glosses":["value (all senses)","security","worth"],"ipa":"/baˈloɾ/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"valores"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f4/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-valor.wav","examples":[{"text":"Eso no tiene valor para nosotros.","en":"That's of no value to us.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/706051","words":[{"g":"that","l":"ése"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"we"}]},{"text":"Parece no tener ningún valor.","en":"It seems worthless.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/119083","words":[{"g":"to seem, to see fit","l":"parecer"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have"},null,null]},{"text":"Es de gran valor.","en":"It is of great value.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454445","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"of / from"},null,null]},{"text":"Era un día muy tranquilo en la bolsa de valores.","en":"It was a very calm day in the stock market.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"day"},null,{"g":"calm"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"bag"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Fue un acto de valor.","en":"It was an act of courage.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/515925","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"act"},{"g":"of / from"},null]}]}